Maintainer: Charly Billaud <charly.billaud@ntu.edu.sg>
Description: Analyzing and visualizing brain connectivity data, including edge-wise connectograms, chord diagrams, network connectograms, heatmaps, and 3D glass brain connectivity plots. FCtools follows Yeo's 7-networks classification, and works with edge vectors from the Brainnetome, Schaefer (100 or 200, each with 19 aseg subcortices), and Automated Anatomical Labeling (AAL) atlases.  
